From 599779412da5336c38b99885cb8381d3e53b44d4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: irgend wer <irgend@wer.de>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 17:01:17 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] ipa: ipu3: Add OV8858 tuning file

Add a tuning file for the OmniVision OV8858, based on the uncalibrated
tuning file with an additional Lsc entry. The shading tables contain
unity gains, as a placeholder for calibration data, which results in the
same image as without lens shading correction.

Signed-off-by: TODO <TODO>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/ipa/ipu3/data/meson.build |   1 +
 src/ipa/ipu3/data/ov8858.yaml | 128 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 129 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/ipa/ipu3/data/ov8858.yaml

